WEBVTT

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.744
from here to there.

00:05:31.744 --> 00:05:34.080
It's what they do all the time.

00:05:34.121 --> 00:05:36.791
The difference between
the policies of right wing

00:05:36.832 --> 00:05:38.501
and left wing parties

00:05:38.501 --> 00:05:42.922
often amounts to a few
percentage points of GDP.

00:05:43.547 --> 00:05:46.050
When faced by a major crisis,

00:05:46.092 --> 00:05:50.304
politicians swiftly shift
far more resources to fight it.

00:05:50.805 --> 00:05:52.973
For example, in 1945,

00:05:53.015 --> 00:05:57.895
the US spent about 36 percent of its GDP

00:05:57.895 --> 00:06:00.189
on winning the Second World War.